            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EQMvdyC4do4fPMxqaNklH4jFg2d\">The pie charts illustrate the age distribution of users across three social media platforms, namely Facebook, YouTube and Twitter, in Australia in 2011.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13803,
