          },
          {
            "id": 464,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EXSLduMnLo4qRCxhwUplSCECggh\">Overall, there were notable similarities in the age distribution patterns across these social networks, with people aged between 18 and 49 making up the majority of users on all three platforms and elderly individuals aged 65 and above consistently representing the smallest user group.</div>\n</div>",
